              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.28.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Imp 28:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.29.39"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "29:39",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.16.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Amaf 16:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atuula ukulakonka ififwaikwa cila bushiku umwabela amafunde yakwa Mose palwa Masabata, imyeshi iyipya elyo ne nshikunkulu shitatu isha cila mwaka, ekutila inshikunkulu ya mukate ushatutumuka, inshikunkulu ya milungu ne nshikunkulu ya nsakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwabela ifipope fyapeele wishi Davidi emo Solomoni apeelele imilimo kuli bashimapepo, elyo na ku bena Levi abali nokutungulula mukulumbanya no kwafwilisha bashimapepo mu milimo ya cila bushiku. Asonta na bakalinda wa mpongolo mu mpuka shabo ukulingana ne mpongolo, pantu ifi efyo Davidi umuntu wakwa Lesa akonkomeshe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tabatalile abafuma kufyo imfumu yakonkomeshe bashimapepo nangu abena Levi mu cintu conse na pa mulandu onse uwakusunga icuma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi imilimo yonse iyakwa Solomoni yalibombeke, ukutula apo umufula wa ŋanda yakwa Yawe wayambile mpaka no kupwisha. Kanshi iŋanda yakwa Yawe efyo yapwile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili Solomoni aya ku Esioni Geberi na ku Elati ku lulamba lwa bemba mu calo ca Edomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Hiramu amutumina amato ayaleensha abantu bakwe, abaishibe icimana bwino. Kanshi aba pamo na bantu bakwa Solomoni epakuya ku Ofiri no kuya letako golide amatalanta imyanda ine na makumi yasano (450)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8:18",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "amatalanta 450:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ekutila amakilo amakana ikumi limo na mutanda (16,000) aya golide.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " no kupeela ku mfumu Solomoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
